Package: ocean-distro
Version: 1.0.1-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: OceanStudio <maintainer@ocean.studio>
Depends: bash, jq, proot, tar, coreutils, zstd, xz-utils, gzip, bzip2, curl, ca-certificates
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: Ocean PRoot Linux distribution and rootfs manager
 Unlocks Debian, Ubuntu, Alpine, Arch, Fedora, openSUSE, Void, Rocky,
 AlmaLinux, Kali, Mint, CentOS, Devuan, Gentoo, and Slackware userland
 universes inside OceanStudio using PRoot virtualization.
